{"ID":"20240205153820-p0sxni7","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153820-p0sxni7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153820-p0sxni7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103923-5gcudoq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612091439-5mug1gv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626085412-8cf5pjm\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"208栀子","type":"doc","updated":"20240821100513"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206103923-5gcudoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103923-5gcudoq","updated":"20240206103931"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产湖北、湖南、江西、福建等地。\n【性状】\t果实倒卵形、椭圆形或长椭圆形，长1.43.5cm，直径0.81.8cm。表面红棕色或红黄色，微有光泽，有翅状纵棱68条，每二翅棱间有纵脉1条，先端有暗黄绿色残存宿萼，先端有68条长形裂片，裂片长12.5cm，宽23mm，多碎断，果实基部收缩成果柄状，末端有圆形果柄痕。果皮薄而脆，内表面鲜黄色或红黄色。有光泽，具隆起的假隔膜2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3条。折断面鲜黄色，种子多数，扁椭圆形或扁矩圆形，聚成球状团块，棕红色，表面有细而密的凹入小点；胚乳角质；胚长形，具心形子叶2片。气微，味微酸苦。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t泻火除烦；清热利湿；凉血解毒主治热病心烦；肝火目赤；头痛；湿热黄疸；淋证；血痢尿血；口舌生疮；疮疡肿毒；扭伤肿痛。\n【炙品】\t炒栀子：取碾碎的栀子，置锅内用文火炒至金黄色，取出，放凉。炒后可以缓和生品性味。\n焦栀子：取碾碎的栀子，置锅内用武火炒至焦糊色，取出，放凉。 改变山栀子坚硬的物理特性，便于煎煮。\n栀子炭：取碾碎的栀子，置锅内用武火炒至黑褐色，但须存性，取出，放凉。 功专凉血止血，用于血热吐血、衄血、尿血、崩漏。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103924-9fcntes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103924-9fcntes","updated":"20240206103924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103924-4fcqfth.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160333-8rk3jla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160333-8rk3jla","updated":"20240717192736"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 401px;","style":"width: 391px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栀子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栀子-20240205160333-9u20fai.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 391px;\" parent-style=\"width: 401px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 584px;","style":"width: 574px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栀子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栀子-20240717192736-zqs8s4t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 574px;\" parent-style=\"width: 584px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821093335-vx2yi67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821093335-vx2yi67","updated":"20240821095459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 475px;","style":"width: 465px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栀子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栀子 1-20240821093517-imo2ati.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 465px;\" parent-style=\"width: 475px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717192830-b07j52e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717192830-b07j52e","updated":"20240821093727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 608px;","style":"width: 598px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栀子 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栀子 1-20240717192830-g77cbcc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 598px;\" parent-style=\"width: 608px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 554px;","style":"width: 544px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栀子 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栀子 3-20240821093727-h0zpfsr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 544px;\" parent-style=\"width: 554px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626085412-8cf5pjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626085412-8cf5pjm","updated":"20240821093538"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 603px;","style":"width: 593px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栀子3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栀子3-20240626085412-3hfhenp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 593px;\" parent-style=\"width: 603px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 536px;","style":"width: 526px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栀子2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栀子2-20240626085432-ciumtav.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 526px;\" parent-style=\"width: 536px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20